{"chapter_id":"main-quest-22043","main_id":22043,"main_title":"雕猫之法","main_description":"在浅濑神社工作的大岛纯平似乎正在为某事而发愁…","chapter_title":"雕猫之法","chapter_number":"","subquest_index":0,"subquest_id":2204301,"subquest_title":"","talk_id":2204301,"sequence":19,"variant":0,"line_id":220430112,"next_line_ids":[220430113],"speaker_type":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speaker_id":3182,"speaker_text_hash":2844979893,"speaker":"大岛纯平","speaker_raw":"大岛纯平","text_hash":4088346370,"text":"你问这个啊…那个，你知道代宫司大人给我的「报酬」是什么吗？","raw_text":"你问这个啊…那个，你知道代宫司大人给我的「报酬」是什么吗？","resolved":true,"source_file":"BinOutput/Talk/Quest/2204301.json"}
{"chapter_id":"main-quest-22043","main_id":22043,"main_title":"雕猫之法","main_description":"在浅濑神社工作的大岛纯平似乎正在为某事而发愁…","chapter_title":"雕猫之法","chapter_number":"","subquest_index":0,"subquest_id":2204301,"subquest_title":"","talk_id":2204301,"sequence":20,"variant":0,"line_id":220430113,"next_line_ids":[220430114],"speaker_type":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speaker_id":3182,"speaker_text_hash":2844979893,"speaker":"大岛纯平","speaker_raw":"大岛纯平","text_hash":539079498,"text":"是一些…瓶瓶罐罐，杯杯盏盏之类的东西。","raw_text":"是一些…瓶瓶罐罐，杯杯盏盏之类的东西。","resolved":true,"source_file":"BinOutput/Talk/Quest/2204301.json"}
{"chapter_id":"main-quest-22043","main_id":22043,"main_title":"雕猫之法","main_description":"在浅濑神社工作的大岛纯平似乎正在为某事而发愁…","chapter_title":"雕猫之法","chapter_number":"","subquest_index":0,"subquest_id":2204301,"subquest_title":"","talk_id":2204301,"sequence":21,"variant":0,"line_id":220430114,"next_line_ids":[220430115],"speaker_type":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speaker_id":3182,"speaker_text_hash":2844979893,"speaker":"大岛纯平","speaker_raw":"大岛纯平","text_hash":636896226,"text":"虽然看起来有点旧了，但我拿回去给人看了之后，发现这些东西居然还颇有些年头，而且也能卖一点钱。","raw_text":"虽然看起来有点旧了，但我拿回去给人看了之后，发现这些东西居然还颇有些年头，而且也能卖一点钱。","resolved":true,"source_file":"BinOutput/Talk/Quest/2204301.json"}
